{#policy}
@summary: Header metadata interoperability notes
# Policy

The CLI currently tolerates additional header metadata keys.
{/policy}

{#implication}
@summary: Guidance for tool consumers reading custom header fields
# Implication

Consumers should avoid depending on unsupported header keys semantically.
{/implication}
